!!
!! Control File for FrontISTR - GRAV on a laminated shell
!! 3 layers of one material (thickness 0.2/0.5/0.3): the deflection must equal
!! that of the single-layer plate (U3 at the tip about -5.5e-3 m for 741)
!!
!SOLUTION, TYPE=STATIC
!BOUNDARY
 ROOT, 1, 6, 0.0
!DLOAD
 PLATE, GRAV, 9.81, 0.0, 0.0, -1.0
!!
!SOLVER, METHOD=CG, PRECOND=3, ITERLOG=NO, TIMELOG=NO
 10000, 1
 1.0e-8, 1.0, 0.0
!WRITE, RESULT
!END
